        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(“Solstice,” “Solstice Advanced Materials,” “we,” “us,” “our,” or the “Company”) is a global, differentiated advanced materials company and a leading global provider of refrigerants, blowing agents, conversion services for the nuclear energy sector, semiconductor materials, protective fibers and healthcare packaging.",
        "start_character": 62,
        "end_character": 380
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Due to the highly differentiated nature of each of our businesses within the ESM segment, we operate each ESM segment business according to its unique needs, leveraging common platforms and functions where applicable.",
        "start_character": 44115,
        "end_character": 44332
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Buffalo R&D center, we combine all major functions to develop and innovate across the Solstice Advanced Materials product portfolio.",
        "start_character": 32256,
        "end_character": 32395
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the last decade, we tailored our products toward highly specialized offerings in targeted, high-growth end markets that value differentiated technology and manufacturing capabilities.",
        "start_character": 2097,
        "end_character": 2285
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Solstice Advanced Materials operates in a constantly evolving regulatory environment, and we are subject to numerous and increasingly complex federal, state, local and foreign legal and regulatory requirements for our operations and products.",
        "start_character": 62200,
        "end_character": 62442
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Together with our joint venture partner General Atomics, we are the only provider of these services in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 23802,
        "end_character": 23913
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also collaborate with leading semiconductor manufacturers and OEMs to provide premium thermal solutions, building on our current portfolio of heat spreaders and thermal interface materials.",
        "start_character": 48907,
        "end_character": 49099
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a global leader in advanced materials, providing innovative and specialized offerings with strategic positions in targeted, high-growth end markets that value differentiated technology and manufacturing capabilities, resulting in a high level of customer intimacy.",
        "start_character": 5973,
        "end_character": 6244
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a leading global provider of refrigerants for the automotive end market, clearly differentiated by global commercial reach, customer relationships and a strong intellectual property portfolio, further strengthened by our position in the vehicle service aftermarket business.",
        "start_character": 22763,
        "end_character": 23044
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are among the highest-reliability producers of sputtering targets and maintain strong capabilities in copper manganese and titanium targets, supplying high-performance products for top semiconductor companies’ manufacturing processes.",
        "start_character": 48417,
        "end_character": 48654
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we are well positioned to utilize our common platforms and manufacturing capabilities to expand into adjacent products and markets in the near-to mid-term.",
        "start_character": 18157,
        "end_character": 18323
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002064953-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002064953-26-000008-836e1d89036a2350",
        "accession_number": "0002064953-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We maintain close relationships with our direct manufacturer customers through collaboration between our product development teams, alignment of our R&D pipeline with customers’ technology roadmaps, trade shows and recurring touchpoints with customers’ top-level management.",
